(6794304, 1020187, 60173, '<td valign="top">This looks great from the thumbnail, but is disappointing full size. The sharpness is lacking, and there''s some slight highlight clipping leaving no detail in some of the white. <br/> <br/>The good news is that it looks great from the thumbnail! That means the composition is strong as is the contrast. It drew me in, so it''s clearly got something powerful going on. It''s a potentially very boring image, but the fisheye added lots of interesting and unexpected curves.</td>', 'This looks great from the thumbnail, but is disappointing full size. The sharpness is lacking, and there''s some slight highlight clipping leaving no detail in some of the white.  The good news is that it looks great from the thumbnail! That means the composition is strong as is the contrast. It drew me in, so it''s clearly got something powerful going on. It''s a potentially very boring image, but the fisheye added lots of interesting and unexpected curves.', '2012-06-13 14:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794305, 1020898, 118154, '<td valign="top">Another for the top ten in my eyes.</td>', 'Another for the top ten in my eyes.', '2012-06-13 14:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794307, 1020943, 118154, '<td valign="top">Ha</td>', 'Ha', '2012-06-13 14:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794309, 1020699, 118154, '<td valign="top">like it</td>', 'like it', '2012-06-13 14:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794312, 1020481, 118154, '<td valign="top">Very good example of this ,the light is super.</td>', 'Very good example of this ,the light is super.', '2012-06-13 14:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794314, 1020780, 60173, '<td valign="top">A good rule of thumb is that people don''t generally want to see dirty objects unless there''s good reason. Why are you showing me a brush full of hair? What is the purpose? In this case we all know that brushes brush hair, so showing a clean brush would have been just as effective.<br/> <br/>Now, with that said look at the bristles in the back. Had you not shown the tips of the brush in the foreground it sort of looks like a forest where the hair is the forest floor.</td>', 'A good rule of thumb is that people don''t generally want to see dirty objects unless there''s good reason. Why are you showing me a brush full of hair? What is the purpose? In this case we all know that brushes brush hair, so showing a clean brush would have been just as effective. Now, with that said look at the bristles in the back. Had you not shown the tips of the brush in the foreground it sort of looks like a forest where the hair is the forest floor.', '2012-06-13 14:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794315, 1020954, 118154, '<td valign="top">The colors are pleasing me.</td>', 'The colors are pleasing me.', '2012-06-13 14:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794316, 1020902, 118154, '<td valign="top">All seems a little out of focus and uninteresting in my view.</td>', 'All seems a little out of focus and uninteresting in my view.', '2012-06-13 14:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794319, 1020786, 118154, '<td valign="top">Think you have pulled this off with the light making this much more than it is.</td>', 'Think you have pulled this off with the light making this much more than it is.', '2012-06-13 14:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794329, 1020417, 10785, '<td valign="top">The birds head is barely noticeable but when I caught it, I thought it was funny!</td>', 'The birds head is barely noticeable but when I caught it, I thought it was funny!', '2012-06-13 14:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794336, 1020699, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like where you were going with this. I think some simplification of the scene would have sent this over the top. Removing the left hand side of the photo and focusing on the two objects would have been brilliant, simple and mundane! The joint in the wall adds clutter and doesn''t strengthen the image. The composition would then have been light at the top and dark at the bottome to anchor the photo with the two shapes in the middle somewhere to add interest.</td>', 'I like where you were going with this. I think some simplification of the scene would have sent this over the top. Removing the left hand side of the photo and focusing on the two objects would have been brilliant, simple and mundane! The joint in the wall adds clutter and doesn''t strengthen the image. The composition would then have been light at the top and dark at the bottome to anchor the photo with the two shapes in the middle somewhere to add interest.', '2012-06-13 14:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794337, 1020763, 10785, '<td valign="top">Impressive night shot. How did you avoid movement?? Can''t wait to see your exposure info.</td>', 'Impressive night shot. How did you avoid movement?? Can''t wait to see your exposure info.', '2012-06-13 14:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
