(6794373, 1020819, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice concept here. I think the shot needs more of the reflection in it, less of the white space at the top.</td>', 'Nice concept here. I think the shot needs more of the reflection in it, less of the white space at the top.', '2012-06-13 15:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794374, 1020776, 93171, '<td valign="top">I hate to seem nitpicky, but this photo 1. has the date listed which really takes away from any image, and 2. isn''t rotated properly.  As I sit here with my head tilted to the left, I''m trying to get past those points, and I think I would actually dig this photo if the girl on the bottom (or the left if rotated) didn''t have her arm/leg cut off.</td>', 'I hate to seem nitpicky, but this photo 1. has the date listed which really takes away from any image, and 2. isn''t rotated properly.  As I sit here with my head tilted to the left, I''m trying to get past those points, and I think I would actually dig this photo if the girl on the bottom (or the left if rotated) didn''t have her arm/leg cut off.', '2012-06-13 15:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
