(6794893, 1020791, 124613, '<td valign="top">Excellent street scene and essence of theme.</td>', 'Excellent street scene and essence of theme.', '2012-06-14 03:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794941, 1020850, 93565, '<td valign="top">Spooky, like a mesmerizing fortune teller''s ball. I keep looking at the black object bottom right, wondering if it really is something or not, but it''s just impossible enough to discern that it keeps tight hold of its mystery. Nicely done.</td>', 'Spooky, like a mesmerizing fortune teller''s ball. I keep looking at the black object bottom right, wondering if it really is something or not, but it''s just impossible enough to discern that it keeps tight hold of its mystery. Nicely done.', '2012-06-14 08:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794942, 1020943, 93565, '<td valign="top">Ah, yes, but it could be Cerberus or Anubis paying us a visit, for all we can tell. I like the crop. Something slightly ominous about the lonely two dog feet upon the stones.</td>', 'Ah, yes, but it could be Cerberus or Anubis paying us a visit, for all we can tell. I like the crop. Something slightly ominous about the lonely two dog feet upon the stones.', '2012-06-14 08:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794947, 1020783, 93565, '<td valign="top">Excellent job of altering the depiction of the subject. The variety of colors make all the difference here.</td>', 'Excellent job of altering the depiction of the subject. The variety of colors make all the difference here.', '2012-06-14 08:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794954, 1020381, 93565, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but seems a bit of a shoehorn to me.</td>', 'Cool shot, but seems a bit of a shoehorn to me.', '2012-06-14 08:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794957, 1020198, 93565, '<td valign="top">An oddly soothing photo of chips and salsa (not sure that I''d ever combined those two up until now...) The blues are surely part of it, but the swirls of the table and the slightly softened details are surely part of it as well. Interesting.</td>', 'An oddly soothing photo of chips and salsa (not sure that I''d ever combined those two up until now...) The blues are surely part of it, but the swirls of the table and the slightly softened details are surely part of it as well. Interesting.', '2012-06-14 08:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794963, 1020740, 93565, '<td valign="top">Personally, I''d say a fruit still life is nearly as typical as one could get in terms of photographing that subject matter, but the colors do add some additional interest.</td>', 'Personally, I''d say a fruit still life is nearly as typical as one could get in terms of photographing that subject matter, but the colors do add some additional interest.', '2012-06-14 08:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794967, 1020854, 93565, '<td valign="top">Under normal circumstances, I''d say this is a very unusual depiction, but this is on DPC, and this ties for soft lit fruit/vegetables in a still life for commonplace approach.<br/>Nice lighting on the subjects, it''s no easy task minimizing shadows from one object on the other for these sorts of shots.</td>', 'Under normal circumstances, I''d say this is a very unusual depiction, but this is on DPC, and this ties for soft lit fruit/vegetables in a still life for commonplace approach.Nice lighting on the subjects, it''s no easy task minimizing shadows from one object on the other for these sorts of shots.', '2012-06-14 08:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794968, 1020933, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the harsh texture of the sidewalk. Very synthetic against the organic leaf.</td>', 'I like the harsh texture of the sidewalk. Very synthetic against the organic leaf.', '2012-06-14 08:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794974, 1019953, 93565, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite discern what is being held in the hand, but this photo leaves me wondering at what it holds, and what other snippets the photo holds, its atmosphere and feel, in spite of the fact that it''s a really simple scene. A bamboozling crop that leaves me asking What? How? and Huh? simultaneously. That, my friend, means you succeeded wildly in this challenge. A rarely given 9 here.</td>', 'I can''t quite discern what is being held in the hand, but this photo leaves me wondering at what it holds, and what other snippets the photo holds, its atmosphere and feel, in spite of the fact that it''s a really simple scene. A bamboozling crop that leaves me asking What? How? and Huh? simultaneously. That, my friend, means you succeeded wildly in this challenge. A rarely given 9 here.', '2012-06-14 08:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794976, 1020402, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like that your image focuses on the meaning, not the object. It''s curious to note that not only is your subject mundane, but so is your depiction, yet your direction is interestingly refreshing and delves beyond the surface of the object. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like that your image focuses on the meaning, not the object. It''s curious to note that not only is your subject mundane, but so is your depiction, yet your direction is interestingly refreshing and delves beyond the surface of the object. Nicely done.', '2012-06-14 08:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6794978, 1020769, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nice BW conversion and your depth of field works wonderfully. I could very easily see this as a stock photo. But at the same time, I don''t find it terribly interesting, as a result, since it isn''t a particularly fresh take on things, either.</td>', 'Very nice BW conversion and your depth of field works wonderfully. I could very easily see this as a stock photo. But at the same time, I don''t find it terribly interesting, as a result, since it isn''t a particularly fresh take on things, either.', '2012-06-14 08:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
