(6795107, 1020838, 142473, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting.  Good job of keeping the details in the shadowed areas.</td>', 'I like the lighting.  Good job of keeping the details in the shadowed areas.', '2012-06-14 13:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6795108, 1020733, 142473, '<td valign="top">This has got to be one of my favorites.  It is a perfect capture of a mundane subject as presented naturally.  But it looks excellent.  The wide angle is key, along with the use of the inventive composition.  Great abstract.</td>', 'This has got to be one of my favorites.  It is a perfect capture of a mundane subject as presented naturally.  But it looks excellent.  The wide angle is key, along with the use of the inventive composition.  Great abstract.', '2012-06-14 13:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6795110, 1020820, 142473, '<td valign="top">I would venture that this subject itself does have interest and is not very mundane.  The image itself is not very engaging and is quite harsh to the eyes.  Compositionally there isn''t much going for it.  A bit too even and obvious for my tastes.  The effect from the processing however is rather interesting.</td>', 'I would venture that this subject itself does have interest and is not very mundane.  The image itself is not very engaging and is quite harsh to the eyes.  Compositionally there isn''t much going for it.  A bit too even and obvious for my tastes.  The effect from the processing however is rather interesting.', '2012-06-14 13:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6795113, 1019918, 142473, '<td valign="top">Balanced, yet unbalanced.  Offset, yet even.  Great silhouettes, nice sky.  I''m a fan.</td>', 'Balanced, yet unbalanced.  Offset, yet even.  Great silhouettes, nice sky.  I''m a fan.', '2012-06-14 13:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6795114, 1020786, 142473, '<td valign="top">A nice image, depicting the object of everyone''s secret desires.  A little more negative space may have done well for this image, as the pillow is a bit too pronounced.  However the harsh light on the otherwise soft subject is an interesting contrast.</td>', 'A nice image, depicting the object of everyone''s secret desires.  A little more negative space may have done well for this image, as the pillow is a bit too pronounced.  However the harsh light on the otherwise soft subject is an interesting contrast.', '2012-06-14 13:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6795115, 1020933, 142473, '<td valign="top">The definition of golden hour.  The textures are interesting, but the focus on the bottom half is distracting to me.</td>', 'The definition of golden hour.  The textures are interesting, but the focus on the bottom half is distracting to me.', '2012-06-14 13:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6795117, 1020945, 142473, '<td valign="top">Quite a non-standard bokeh here which leads the unfocused regions to be quite uneven and a bit off putting personally.</td>', 'Quite a non-standard bokeh here which leads the unfocused regions to be quite uneven and a bit off putting personally.', '2012-06-14 13:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6795119, 1020417, 142473, '<td valign="top">I like the message.  Though the saturation and brightness is quite heavy for my tastes.  Toned down it might be worth a second look.</td>', 'I like the message.  Though the saturation and brightness is quite heavy for my tastes.  Toned down it might be worth a second look.', '2012-06-14 13:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
