(6798098, 1020207, 12611, '<td valign="top">my style of shot. I think you could have made that stalk pop and thats all thats holding you back.</td>', 'my style of shot. I think you could have made that stalk pop and thats all thats holding you back.', '2012-06-19 16:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798099, 1020852, 142473, '<td valign="top">I keep looking at this one, wondering what to say.  It doesn''t immediately jump out to me, but somehow it does work.  I think what feels ''off'' to me is the coloring.  The rust color contrasts with what I think should be appropriate for a kitchen utensil.  A blue overlay would lend to a nice cleanliness... but maybe that''s not the intent here.</td>', 'I keep looking at this one, wondering what to say.  It doesn''t immediately jump out to me, but somehow it does work.  I think what feels ''off'' to me is the coloring.  The rust color contrasts with what I think should be appropriate for a kitchen utensil.  A blue overlay would lend to a nice cleanliness... but maybe that''s not the intent here.', '2012-06-19 16:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798100, 1020908, 12611, '<td valign="top">subtle, lavender goodness.</td>', 'subtle, lavender goodness.', '2012-06-19 16:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798102, 1020775, 142473, '<td valign="top">To me, the left half of this image is much more interesting than the right.  Crop the glasses out, and I think this is quite interesting.</td>', 'To me, the left half of this image is much more interesting than the right.  Crop the glasses out, and I think this is quite interesting.', '2012-06-19 16:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798104, 1020960, 142473, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.  I think a B&amp;W would have had even more impact.  Fun details all over.  Are those chickens in the side alley?  I do think I might have tried to get it head-on... but then I''d miss the chickens...</td>', 'Great perspective.  I think a B&W would have had even more impact.  Fun details all over.  Are those chickens in the side alley?  I do think I might have tried to get it head-on... but then I''d miss the chickens...', '2012-06-19 16:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798107, 1020331, 142473, '<td valign="top">Interesting/quirky lower-half background to choose.  Quite muddy, but the reflected colors are nice.  I think I might have gotten rid of the pink at the bottom right... might have made it feel a bit more even.</td>', 'Interesting/quirky lower-half background to choose.  Quite muddy, but the reflected colors are nice.  I think I might have gotten rid of the pink at the bottom right... might have made it feel a bit more even.', '2012-06-19 16:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798112, 1020847, 12611, '<td valign="top">I never like it when people say "excellent find" because it is often so much more than that. this shot is an example of that, good find does not go far enough, what you did is more akin to extracting art from the world, seeing it in the mundane.<br/>(if you were the one to spray paint the blue and purple- I take it all back- just kidding.)</td>', 'I never like it when people say "excellent find" because it is often so much more than that. this shot is an example of that, good find does not go far enough, what you did is more akin to extracting art from the world, seeing it in the mundane.(if you were the one to spray paint the blue and purple- I take it all back- just kidding.)', '2012-06-19 16:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798129, 1020776, 30669, '<td valign="top">Picture on its side. Time and date stamp. Pole coming out of guys head.<br/>Dictionary -Mundane:Common,ordinary,unimaginative. I guess this does fit category. Sorry.</td>', 'Picture on its side. Time and date stamp. Pole coming out of guys head.Dictionary -Mundane:Common,ordinary,unimaginative. I guess this does fit category. Sorry.', '2012-06-19 17:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
